  "contentHtml": "<p>#설탕 #농도 #용액 #용질 #용매<br><br>--------------------아래에 설명을 추가해주세요^^</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eb3081e8997b4d5f60fa408bd68ef193511009ed\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eb3081e8997b4d5f60fa408bd68ef193511009ed\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"778\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">저렇게나 많이?<br><br>외국자료니까,<br>우리나라 기준으로 다시 계산해보면?<br><br>코카콜라 355ml, 당류 38g<br>각설탕 1개가 대략 3g정도라 치면, 13개정도.<br>실은 더 많음.<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/39568e8494e267f48073fad44239e8741a2ca8bb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/39568e8494e267f48073fad44239e8741a2ca8bb\" data-origin-width=\"780\" data-origin-height=\"550\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7c8c264cdffd008a4e94c55f7d047d78d57bff44\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7c8c264cdffd008a4e94c55f7d047d78d57bff44\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"786\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">1kg에 2개짜리 147개가 들었으므로 1개당 3.4g<br><br><br><br> </p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
